  Base language = English. Translations live in values-<lang>/ (e.g. values-ru/).
  Missing translations fall back here.

  Key convention: feature_element, snake_case, lowercase.
    e.g. call_btn_mic, share_resolution, call_alone_title
  Icon-only buttons still need a string (used as contentDescription for a11y).
  Use <plurals> for counts (Russian needs one/few/many/other).
  Placeholders: %1$s text, %1$d number. Do not concatenate strings in code.
-->
